# Spec-correct line-ending behavior for this repository.
#
# Asserts LF normalization regardless of the contributor's local
# core.autocrlf setting (Git for Windows defaults to autocrlf=true,
# which silently converts LF blobs to CRLF in the working tree on
# checkout). This file makes the line-ending contract explicit.
#
# Reference: https://git-scm.com/docs/gitattributes

# Default: auto-detect text files, normalize to LF on commit and in
# the working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Common binary types (no normalization, no diff).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.tar binary
*.gz binary
